{"lauren:Let’s meet at the café at ten.":"9bd337dffac4046d8bf060287ebc9849a444faa7a5ad8dc494b8a99dc5bcade2","lauren:Calling the portal unrepresentative may undermine support for future funding.":"6fb6890375372fad735d02b2c82fcf8e8feeb6525e23e5ec00377a68531a576e","lauren:The portal is a valuable access tool, but its selection reflects prior demand rather than a demonstrated cross-section of local history. A community-led cataloguing phase would make the next expansion more defensible.":"efa67d8ca893fbfd1ff6aecb78109c3424350bc98741b48c8eb7d5e6e550242c","lauren:You are right.":"35968ebc2328109026cb0355e0702926f75836540491e587d467d0ad16b92f2c","lauren:We arrived before you.":"923a7bc6e94629258c846f16aad346720c7e654ffe7aa9a2fb9b0647f73e03c1","lauren:I think I'll visit my aunt next week.":"0146b700c8cb1cd64429011559d09e7d934be125c271d3b4375adf7e3c6114a3"}